# Search Provider Configuration for find_top_agents
# Choose either Option 1 (Serper.dev) or Option 2 (Google Custom Search API)

# Option 1: Serper.dev (Fast setup, 2,500 free queries, no credit card required)
# Sign up at: https://serper.dev
SERPER_API_KEY=your_serper_api_key_here

# Option 2: Google Custom Search JSON API (Official Google API, 100 free queries/day)
# 1. Enable "Custom Search API" in Google Cloud Console and generate an API key
# 2. Create a Programmable Search Engine at https://programmablesearchengine.google.com
#    (Ensure "Search the entire web" is toggled ON)
# GOOGLE_API_KEY=your_google_cloud_api_key_here
# GOOGLE_CSE_ID=your_search_engine_cx_id_here
